		{
			"ref_slug": "crs-welcome",
			"title": "Welcome and how this works",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Welcome and how this works</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Glad you're here. This page covers how the course runs and where to find things, so you can get on with the actual work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How the modules work</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Each module</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">A recording, a worksheet, and anything referenced on the call</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">New modules</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Open up as we reach them</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Recordings</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Up within a day</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your access</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Stays open after the course ends</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where to start</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Read this page, then have a look at the recommended tools</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Work through Module 1 before the next session</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Come back to any module whenever you need it</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Nobody finishes a course by watching it. The worksheets are the bit that changes anything.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If you get stuck</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leave a comment on the module page you're stuck on. That keeps the question attached to the thing it's about, and other people on the course can see the answer too.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rewrite the table to match how you release your course. Drip, all at once, or opened live as you go all work with this structure. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "crs-welcome",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "crs-tools",
			"title": "Recommended tools",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recommended tools</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>None of this is required. It's what past groups ended up using and stuck with.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Planning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Somewhere to keep the work visible between sessions. The one you'll actually open is the right one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the options</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Writing</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For the worksheets and anything you're drafting. A shared document is easier to get feedback on than a file on your desktop.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the options</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tracking</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A way to see whether you did the thing, without it becoming a second job.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the options</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Swap these for what you actually recommend and point the links wherever you like. Three columns sit comfortably; a fourth starts to squeeze on a phone. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "crs-tools",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "crs-module-1",
			"title": "Module 1: Clients",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Module 1: Clients</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Session recording</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">The video for this module goes here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>An ideal client profile isn't about demographics. It's about working style, budget and how they make decisions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The clients who drain you usually showed you who they were in the first conversation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Saying no to the wrong fit is easier when you've written down what the wrong fit looks like.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You can qualify on a call without it feeling like an interrogation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the next session</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Write your ideal client profile in five bullets</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>List the three warning signs you've ignored before</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Try the qualifying questions on your next enquiry</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ideal client worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discovery call script</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note: the shape of a module page</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Replace the grey box with your video embed, then fill in the takeaways, the actions and anything you pointed people at. Duplicate this page for each module.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Modules you haven't got to yet are set to Inactive on the portal home, so they show greyed out and can't be opened. Switch one to Active when it opens. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⚡️ Quick tip</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Turn comments on for module pages and questions stay attached to the module they're about, instead of scrolling away in a chat app. People answer each other, and you end up with a record of where everyone actually got stuck, which is the best guide to what to rewrite next time. <a href=\"https://client-portal.io/support/enable-comments-in-your-portals-y8q7z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to enable comments in your portals</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "crs-module-1",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "crs-module-2",
			"title": "Module 2: Systems",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Module 2: Systems</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Session recording</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">The video for this module goes here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key takeaways</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A process you keep in your head is a process only you can run.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Write it down badly first. A rough checklist beats a perfect one you never finish.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Most of the time saved comes from the handful of things you do on every single job.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Templates go stale. Put a date in the calendar to look at them again.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-green\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-green\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the next session</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Map one process end to end, start to finish</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Turn the emails you retype most into templates</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Upload your process map before the next session</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resources mentioned</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Process mapping worksheet</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Email template pack</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->",
			"post_name": "crs-module-2",
			"meta": []
		}
	],
